<title>POLAND: ZASADA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.16 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.87 vs   0.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.07 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		   24.04 vs  28.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.36 vs   5.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.59 vs   9.35</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.64 vs  19.53</p>
<p> Sales		  240.95 vs 182.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
